    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "BWANA kuilindia Jerusalemu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 31:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni bugha kwa awo wiseagha cha Misri kulola wutesia, na kukusaghika na farasi na magare ghawo gha wuda wei angu ghiko mengi, na wajoki farasi wei angu wiko na ndighi; nawo ndewikusaghikagha na Mlungu, Mweli wa Israeli, hata kulola wutesia kwa BWANA anduangi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.31.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.31.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 31:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na uo nuo uwadie hikima, nuo utoteshagha. Uo ndeghalusagha malagho ghake, ela uchawikaba awo wibonyagha wuwiwi, na awo wiwitesiagha wabonyi kiwiwi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.31.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.31.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 31:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wamisri ni wadamu tu si Mlungu kungi; farasi rawo ni nyamandu riko na mimbi, si roho ringi. BWANA ukaghorua mkonu ghwake, mbari ya wandu iwadie ndighi ichakuwa, na iyo mbari yaawuyateselwa ichaghwa; na huwo wose wichatota.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.31.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.31.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 31:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.31.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.31.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 31:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "BWANA wanizerie huwu, “Sa iji koni shimba angu mwana wa shimba wirurumagha wikilindia madiwo ghawo, wiseturuswagha ni chwaka ra walisha wengi, angu kuoboshwa ni ndoghoi rawo, niko koni na BWANA wa majeshi uchaasea kubonya wuda kulindia Mghondi ghwa Sioni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.31.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.31.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 31:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Seji nyonyi ichimariagha kijungu chiko na wana wake, ni huwo koni BWANA wa majeshi uchaaghulindia muzi ghwa Jerusalemu. Uchaghulindia, ughukire na kughuvuvua.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.31.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.31.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 31:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.31.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.31.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 31:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mmburienyi Mlungu uo mumleghie nandighi ee wandu wa Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.31.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.31.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 31:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa kukaia ngelo ichavika, na kula umu onyu uchaida milimu yake ya feza na ya dhahabu moreibonyereghe kwa wundu ghwa kaung'a renyu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.31.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.31.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 31:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ashuru ichanonwa kwa lufu luseko lwa kidamu, ee, uchamerelwa ni lufu luseko lwa kidamu; Waashuru wichakimbia kufuma wudenyi, na wana wawo wichadumikishwa kwa ndighi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.31.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.31.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 31:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "M'baa wake uchakimbia kwa wowa, na wabaa wawo wa kazi wichakimbia kwa wowa na kuisigha bendera yawo. Agho ghaaghorwa ni BWANA uo modo ghwake ghuakagha Sioni na iwiwi jake jikaiagha Jerusalemu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.31.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.31.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
